<section id="features" aria-labelledby="ft-title" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">What you get</p>
      <h2 id="ft-title">Everything a representative needs, in one verified account</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="pillars">

      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-head">
          <span class="pillar-tag">Legitimacy</span>
          <h3>Be unmistakably you</h3>
          <p>Proof that it's really you, recognised in every app on the network.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="features">
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 2l6 2.5v5c0 4-2.7 6.7-6 8.5-3.3-1.8-6-4.5-6-8.5v-5z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M7 10l2 2 4-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>Verified handle and badge</h4><p>Your <span class="mono">name.rostrum.eu</span> handle is checked against the European Parliament's register, and the badge shows in Bluesky, mu and every Atmosphere app.</p></div>
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M5 15L15 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>Anti-impersonation</h4><p>Look-alike accounts are flagged across the network, and suspected deepfakes of you are labelled and reviewed quickly.</p></div>
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="14" height="10" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M6 9h8M6 12h5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>Transparency labels</h4><p>Clear labels for AI-generated media, paid promotion and party affiliation, so your integrity is visible at a glance.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-head">
          <span class="pillar-tag">Ownership</span>
          <h3>Own your account, your audience and your record</h3>
          <p>Your presence belongs to you, not to a platform.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="features">
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10h11M10 5l5 5-5 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>Portable EU-hosted account</h4><p>Your data is hosted in the EU on Eurosky. Move to another provider whenever you choose and keep every follower.</p></div>
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="14" height="14" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M3 7h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>Your own website</h4><p>A public page built from your account: biography, priorities, voting record, press kit and contact. It updates itself.</p></div>
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="14" cy="9" r="2.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M2 17c.6-3 2.6-4.5 5-4.5s4.4 1.5 5 4.5M12 17c.3-2 1.3-3.2 3-3.2 1.4 0 2.4.8 3 2.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>Your office, delegated</h4><p>Staff draft, schedule and reply under permissions you set, and every action is logged under their name.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-head">
          <span class="pillar-tag">Direct line</span>
          <h3>Hear from the people you represent</h3>
          <p>Structured, two-way contact with citizens, not just a stream of mentions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="features">
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5h14v8H8l-4 3v-3H3z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>Constituent inbox and Q&amp;A</h4><p>Questions are sorted by topic and member state, and you can answer privately or publish the answer for everyone.</p></div>
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 16V9M10 16V4M16 16v-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>Polls and consultations</h4><p>Ask citizens what they think. Results from verified residents are shown separately, so you can bring real evidence to committee.</p></div>
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h7l3 3v11H5z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M8 10h5M8 13h5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>Petitions</h4><p>Citizens start and sign petitions, and you can sponsor or respond. Each one links to the Parliament's official routes.</p></div>
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="2.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Live town halls</h4><p>Scheduled public sessions with questions voted up by participants. Each is subtitled in 24 languages and archived to your record.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-head">
          <span class="pillar-tag">Influence</span>
          <h3>Shape the European conversation</h3>
          <p>Be seen where the debate on each file actually happens.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="features">
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 4h14M3 8h14M3 12h9M3 16h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>Topic hubs on EU files</h4><p>Cross-party feeds on the files that matter, from AI and energy to agriculture and migration. Join the debate where experts and the press already follow it.</p></div>
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="14" height="12" rx="1.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M6 8h8M6 11h8M6 14h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>Press room</h4><p>Verified journalists can follow your releases, request comment and download your press kit, all in one place.</p></div>
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 3h9l3 3v11H4z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M7 9l2 2 4-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>Your legislative record</h4><p>Votes, reports, amendments and committee work flow in from the Parliament's open data and appear next to what you say.</p></div>
          <div class="feature"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 15l4-5 3 3 5-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M3 17h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>Insights without surveillance</h4><p>See reach and engagement by topic and member state. Insights are aggregated and privacy-preserving, with no ads and no data sold.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
